* {{alter|ru|вѣкъ||ru-PRO}}

====Noun====
{{ru-noun+|c||(1)}}

# [[century]]
#: {{syn|ru|столе́тие}}
#: {{uxi|ru|XXI '''век''', 21 '''век''', два́дцать пе́рвый '''век'''|21st century}}
# [[lifetime]]
#: {{syn|ru|жизнь}}
# [[age]], [[epoch]], [[era]], [[period]]
#: {{syn|ru|пери́од|э́ра|эпо́ха}}
# {{lb|ru|geology}} [[age]]
#: {{syn|ru|геологи́ческий век}}

=====Declension=====
{{ru-noun-table|c||(1)}}

=====Usage notes=====
* A locative form {{m|ru|веку́}} is found in the expression {{m|ru|[[на]] [[свой|своём]] '''веку́'''||in one's lifetime}} but not otherwise used; compare {{m|ru|[[в]] [[девятнадцатый|девятна́дцатом]] '''ве́ке'''||in the 19th century}}.
* A partitive form {{m|ru|ве́ку}} is found in the expression {{m|ru|приба́вить '''ве́ку'''||to [[extend]] (someone's) [[life]]|lit=to add a lifetime}}.
* An alternative plural {{m|ru|ве́ки}} is found in the following expressions:
** {{m|ru|[[в]] [[кой|кои]][[-то]] '''ве́ки'''||very rarely, once in a very long time; finally|lit=into some centuries}}
** {{m|ru|[[в]] '''ве́ки''' [[век|веко́в]]||forever and ever|lit=into the ages of ages}}
** {{m|ru|[[на]] '''ве́ки''' [[вечный|ве́чные]]||forever|lit=onto the eternal ages}}
** {{m|ru|[[прожи́ть]] [[аредов|а́редовы]] '''ве́ки'''||to live a long life|lit=to live an old curmudgeon's lifetimes}}

